{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS检查完全磁盘访问权限。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Full Disk Access Permission Check。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.file-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS检查完全磁盘访问权限","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS检查完全磁盘访问权限\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清账号、网络、主机或云资源\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"e26c0f76-2e80-445b-9e98-ab5532ccc46f","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"file where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.action == \"open\" and\n  file.path == \"/Library/Preferences/com.apple.TimeMachine.plist\" and\n  (process.name in (\"osascript\", \"perl\", \"node\", \"ruby\", \"bash\", \"sh\", \"Terminal\") or\n   process.name like \"python*\" or\n   process.code_signature.trusted == false or\n   process.code_signature.exists == false)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1083","name":"File and Directory Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1083/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.006","name":"TCC Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.006","name":"TCC Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
